# A directory source is installed by COPYING this checkout, so nothing below has any
# business in a plugin cache. Whether the installer honours this file is undocumented
# (see the spec, section 9): it is a statement of intent, and the standing answer to a
# dirty checkout is still to clean the checkout.
#
# Everything the spec's section 9 ships stays OUT of this list on purpose:
# .claude-plugin/, skills/, agents/, hooks/, scripts/, tests/, examples/, docs/, README.md.
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.log
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.in_use/
.superpowers/
